A browser for the first OAuth login"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Clone and build the plugin:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Install the built checkout into a DSH profile and start DSH:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"This repository is not published to npm, so installation currently uses the\nlocal checkout. Adding t"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"he bundle to the profile also adds the bundled\nSpringbrand MCP connection; there is no separate MCP "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"rofile also adds the bundled\nSpringbrand MCP connection; there is no separate MCP registration step."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The first startup opens a browser for Springbrand login and consent. After\nauthorization, open **Set"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"tings → Plugins → MCP Connections** to see the live\nconnection status and registered capabilities. Y"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ou can also use these tools to\nverify the bundled connection:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- `mcp__springbrand__search_capabilities`\n- `mcp__springbrand__execute_capability`"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Use"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Ask the agent to search the Springbrand capability catalog, for example:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The expected call flow is:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"When calling `execute_capability`, use the complete `name` returned by\n`search_capabilities`, such a"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"s\n`platform:springbrand@0:springbrand.resources.list`. Do not replace it with\nthe shorter `action_id"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"`, such as `springbrand.resources.list`."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The plugin adds this tool-selection guidance to the agent automatically, so a\nnormal user request is"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" sufficient; manual tool invocation is not required."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Manage connections in DSH Web"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Open **Settings → Plugins → MCP Connections**, enter a unique server name and\nthe server's HTTPS MCP"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" URL, then select **Add and sign in**. Complete the OAuth\nflow in the browser that opens. DSH loads "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"the new connection and the page shows\nits live status and actual registered tools. Select **Remove**"},{"id":"p27s4","text":" on a connection\nto unload its tools and remove or disable it in the permanent profile."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The button writes the connection permanently to\n`~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`. Restarting D"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"SH keeps the connection;\nthere is no temporary `--patch` command."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The bundled defaults are defined in\n`springbrand.cordis.yml`:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Field | Description | Default |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| `serverName` | Namespace used in registered DSH tool names | `springbrand` |\n| `url` | HTTPS Strea"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"mable HTTP MCP endpoint | `https://connector.springbrand.ai/mcp` |\n| `credentialRef` | DSH credentia"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"l reference | `SPRINGBRAND_MCP_OAUTH_PRODUCTION` |\n| `scope` | Optional OAuth scope | Discovered fro"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"m the server |\n| `callbackPort` | Loopback callback port; `0` selects a free port | `0` |\n| `authori"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"zationTimeoutMs` | Browser authorization timeout | `300000` |\n| `toolCallTimeoutMs` | Timeout for on"},{"id":"p33s6","text":"e MCP tool call | `60000` |\n| `failOnStartupError` | Fail activation when the first connection fails"},{"id":"p33s7","text":" | `true` |\n| `reconnect` | Exponential reconnect policy | Enabled |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Manual configuration"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The Web page is the default setup path. To configure a connection manually,\nadd it to the same perma"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"nent Web profile file at\n`~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The server must support OAuth and MCP Streamable HTTP. Its first connection\nopens the browser author"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ization flow. `serverName` must be unique within the\nDSH process and becomes part of the registered "},{"id":"p37s3","text":"tool names, for example\n`mcp__my-mcp__search`."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Security notes"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- OAuth state is stored through the DSH credential service, not in this\nrepository.\n- The callback l"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"istener binds to the local loopback interface.\n- Do not configure an `Authorization` header; the OAu"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"th client owns it.\n- Never commit access tokens, refresh tokens, or exported credential data."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Development and self-check"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"For a DSH load-level check, install the checkout into a profile and start it.\nComplete the OAuth log"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"vel check, install the checkout into a profile and start it.\nComplete the OAuth login when prompted:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Ecosystem metadata"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"- Package name: `@dsh-external/dsh-oauth-mcp-client`\n- Discovery topic: `dsh-plugin`\n- Directory: Aw"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"@dsh-external/dsh-oauth-mcp-client`\n- Discovery topic: `dsh-plugin`\n- Directory: Awesome DSH Plugins"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"MIT. `src/connection.ts` and `src/tools.ts` are adapted from DeepSeek Harness\n`@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"client` under the MIT License."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

